#: ../../../reference/host-api.md:658
msgid "Explicit Stream: `.sync_on()`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/host-api.md:660
msgid ""
"Bypasses the policy entirely. All operations given the same stream execute "
"in call order:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/host-api.md:663
msgid ""
"let stream = device.new_stream()?;\n"
"let a = op_a.sync_on(&stream)?;  // Stream X\n"
"let b = op_b.sync_on(&stream)?;  // Stream X — guaranteed after op_a\n"
msgstr ""

